<li>Details about registration, payment, cancellation, terms and conditions can be viewed at Registered programs -&nbsp;<a href="https://ottawa.ca/en/recreation-and-parks/courses-and-camps/registered-programs-what-you-need-know">What you need to know</a>.</li>
